    60	
    61	At Step 4, check grayscale structure, copy and provenance and record issues for testing. The complete wireframe quality gate runs within the existing Step 5 gate (below), not here. No centered three-icon row, vague hero over three cards, arbitrary KPI row, icon soup or unsourced data survives structural review. A placeholder or missing decision is listed explicitly. Exit with the complete grayscale set and testable issues, not a polished home page alone.
